[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Because these are hidden, mutable, and *never reset*, **call-sequence position
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m is itself a configuration axis**: `findrep(1,2,3,4)` returns a different value
